# USFDS web client configuration. Copy to `.env` only if you need to override the default.
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL: base URL of the usfds-server REST API.
# Leave unset (default) to use the same-origin `/api` path:
#   - `npm run dev`: Vite proxies `/api` to http://127.0.0.1:8200 (server default USFDS_PORT).
#   - Electron / file:// build: falls back to http://127.0.0.1:8200/api.
#   - Docker: nginx proxies `/api` to the server container.
# Tests ignore this value (vite.config.ts `test.env` forces `/api`).
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8200/api
